#: components/trait-ldn-tables.php:801
msgid ""
"These are the shape and weight combinations with the most diamonds on the "
"market, which makes them the sizes buyers are actually choosing. Each price "
"is the median for that one shape at that one weight, so it is a firmer "
"number than the all-shapes figures higher up this page."
